CNVS PROJECT TASK LOG
====================

Purpose
-------
Track completed repository work and the implementation stages required to
reach the first operational CNVS MVP. This file is a project roadmap, not proof
that planned capabilities have been implemented.

Status key: DONE = completed; TODO = not started; IN PROGRESS = active.
Last updated: 2026-10-08
Current project status: PARTIAL MVP IMPLEMENTATION; MVP NOT IMPLEMENTED


